time-traveling wand of yours...

490
00:38:56,251 --> 00:38:59,628
...and we had to do it all over again,
I'd make the same call.

491
00:39:02,048 --> 00:39:04,925
I don't know what's gonna happen
when these seals are broken.

492
00:39:05,093 --> 00:39:07,428
Hell, I don't know
what's gonna happen tomorrow.

493
00:39:07,595 --> 00:39:10,431
But what I do know is that this here...

494
00:39:11,141 --> 00:39:15,060
...these kids, the swings, the trees...

495
00:39:15,228 --> 00:39:19,356
...all of it is still here
because of my brother and me.

496
00:39:21,860 --> 00:39:23,402
You misunderstand me, Dean.

497
00:39:23,570 --> 00:39:27,406
I'm not like you think. l was praying
that you would choose to save the town.

498
00:39:27,574 --> 00:39:28,949
You were?

499
00:39:29,117 --> 00:39:35,789
These people,
they are all my father's creations.

500
00:39:36,374 --> 00:39:38,250
They are works of art.

501
00:39:39,461 --> 00:39:43,422
And yet, even though you
stopped Samhain, the seal was broken.

502
00:39:43,590 --> 00:39:47,426
And we are one step closer
to hell on Earth for all creation.

503
00:39:47,594 --> 00:39:51,096
And that's not an expression,
Dean. It's literal.

504
00:39:52,307 --> 00:39:55,684
You, of all people,
should appreciate what that means.

505
00:40:00,148 --> 00:40:03,484
Can l tell you something
if you promise not to tell another soul?

506
00:40:03,651 --> 00:40:04,818
Okay.

507
00:40:04,986 --> 00:40:10,657
I'm not a hammer, as you say.

508
00:40:12,160 --> 00:40:14,328
I have questions. l....

509
00:40:15,163 --> 00:40:17,331
I have doubts.

510
00:40:18,541 --> 00:40:23,337
I don't know what is right
and what is wrong anymore...

511
00:40:23,922 --> 00:40:25,798
...whether you passed or failed here.

512
00:40:27,801 --> 00:40:33,138
But in the coming months
you will have more decisions to make.

513
00:40:33,807 --> 00:40:37,226
I don't envy the weight
that's on your shoulders, Dean.

514
00:40:39,813 --> 00:40:42,022
I truly don't.

515
00:41:33,116 --> 00:41:35,117
[ENGLISH SDH]

